Hina's Drift Club - 240Z G-Nose

The club's analogue classic. A naturally aspirated L28, five-speed manual and progressive mechanical limited-slip differential reward momentum, measured transitions and smooth throttle control. Hina's Drifters 240Z tyres pair the shared HDC drift behaviour with this car's native tyre size.

The tuned G-Nose body and native customization are retained. This is an authored HDC drift tune, with a 270 Nm peak and approximately 229 PS estimated from its torque curve, rather than a factory Nissan specification. Start with the default setup and build speed gradually.
